==Alemannic German==
{{rfv}}
===Verb===
'''heben'''

# to [[have]]; to [[possess]]
#: ''Ik '''hebe''' twi buke.'' &ndash; I have two books.
# {{auxiliary|lang=gsw}} used with infinitive of verb to show obligation; to have to
#: ''Zö '''hefst''' neh skuel guen.'' &ndash; You have to go to school.
# {{auxiliary|lang=gsw}} used with past participle to form the present perfect tense
#: ''Wei '''heben''' neh skuel ëgun.'' &ndash; We have gone to school.

